        {
         "t": "heading",
         "level": "p",
         "text": "Why it matters",
         "classes": []
        },
        {
         "t": "heading",
         "level": "h2",
         "text": "What Is Included in Small Business Branding?",
         "align": "left",
         "classes": []
        },
        {
         "t": "text",
         "html": "<p>Small business branding is the set of visual choices that make your business recognizable and consistent: your logo and its variations, a color palette, typography, and a few rules for how they are used. Those choices then carry into business cards, social media, signs, uniforms, packaging and your website.</p><p>Consistency is what builds recognition. When your food truck, Instagram profile and invoice all use the same colors and type, customers remember you faster and trust you sooner. Without a system, every new flyer or post starts from scratch and the brand slowly drifts. A short brand guide keeps you, your staff and your printer on the same page.</p>",
         "align": "left",
         "classes": []
        },
        {
         "t": "list",
         "items": [
          {
           "text": "Primary logo plus stacked, horizontal and icon versions",
           "icon": "fas fa-check-circle"
          },
          {
           "text": "HEX, RGB and CMYK color values for screen and print",
           "icon": "fas fa-check-circle"
          },
          {
           "text": "Font pairings for headlines and body text",
           "icon": "fas fa-check-circle"
          }
         ],
         "classes": []
        }
       ]
      },
