         "t": "heading",
         "level": "h2",
         "text": "Building a Brand on an AI-Generated Logo? Fix the Foundation First",
         "align": "left",
         "classes": []
        },
        {
         "t": "text",
         "html": "<p>A brand system only works if the logo file underneath it is solid. AI image tools give you a single flat picture, usually with soft edges, invented letters and colors that shift between screen and print. We rebuild AI-made logos by hand as clean vectors, set the name in a real font and define exact color values, so every branded piece starts from a dependable master.</p><p>Learn how our <a href=\"/fix-ai-generated-logo/\">AI logo cleanup and vector conversion</a> works, or send us your file for a free review.</p>",
         "align": "left",
         "classes": []
        },
