    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": "h2",
     "text": "Where Can I Get Small Business Branding in Austin?",
     "align": "left",
     "classes": []
    },
    {
     "t": "text",
     "html": "<p>Logo Design Austin builds brands for small businesses across Austin and Central Texas, fully online. You talk with a designer by phone or text, review concepts on your phone and get a complete, organized set of brand files at the end.</p><h3>Branding for restaurants, bars and shops on South Congress (78704) and in East Austin (78702)</h3><p>Hospitality and retail brands live on menus, cups, signs and social media. A clear palette and a recognizable icon make every one of those touchpoints feel like the same place.</p><h3>Startup and tech branding near the Domain (78758) and Downtown (78701)</h3><p>Young companies need a professional identity quickly for pitch decks, launch pages and event booths. We focus on a flexible logo suite and digital-first brand assets.</p><h3>Service business branding in Round Rock (78664), Cedar Park (78613) and Georgetown (78626)</h3><p>Contractors, cleaners and home service companies benefit from bold, consistent branding across trucks, uniforms, yard signs and door hangers.</p><h3>How much does branding cost in Austin?</h3><p>A custom logo at Logo Design Austin is priced from $125 to $175, depending on complexity, and supporting materials such as business cards and social headers can be added once the logo is approved. For new businesses, the $950 <a href=\"/business-packages/\">Business Starter Package</a> combines a logo, a basic website and 150 business cards. Custom logo design has no upfront charge; you pay after you approve.</p>",
     "align": "left",
     "classes": []
    },
